# Seed config for Control Center 2.x, Prometheus and Alertmanager, from confluentinc/cp-all-in-one
# 8.4.0-post (cp-all-in-one/vol/config). The two web-config files are empty on purpose: they
# only have to exist. Control Center rewrites trigger_rules-/alertmanager-generated.yml when you
# define alerts in the UI; anything else it writes here is ignored.
*
!.gitignore
!*-generated.yml
!web-config-*.yml
